### API 需启用 local profile；先执行 sql/002-user.sql
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@userId = 1

### 创建；将返回的字符串 ID 填入 userId
POST {{base}}/api/dev/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"nickname":"第一位主播","avatarUrl":""}

### 查询当前 version
GET {{base}}/api/dev/users/{{userId}}

### 完整替换资料；version 必须来自最近一次查询
PUT {{base}}/api/dev/users/{{userId}}/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{"nickname":"新的昵称","avatarUrl":"https://example.com/avatar.png","version":0}

### 再次使用旧 version 应得到 409
PUT {{base}}/api/dev/users/{{userId}}/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{"nickname":"过期修改","avatarUrl":"","version":0}
